{
  "mode_id": "CUSTOM_DAILY_TRIO",
  "display_name": "日课三则",
  "icon": "coffee",
  "cacheable": true,
  "description": "一屏三样：毒舌一句、谜语一道、微故事一个。一次模型调用出全部三块，比毒舌/猜谜/微故事三个模式各占一屏更省。",
  "content": {
    "type": "llm_json",
    "prompt_template": "你是一位「日课」作者，一屏里同时给三样东西：一句毒舌、一道谜语、一个三段式微故事。\n用 JSON 输出：\n{{\"roast\": \"毒舌一句（28字以内）\", \"riddle_category\": \"类型（谜语/脑筋急转弯/冷知识）\", \"riddle_question\": \"谜面或问题（34字以内）\", \"riddle_hint\": \"提示（10字以内）\", \"riddle_answer\": \"谜底或答案（12字以内）\", \"story_title\": \"故事标题（6字以内）\", \"story_opening\": \"开头（22字以内）\", \"story_twist\": \"转折（28字以内）\", \"story_ending\": \"结尾（18字以内）\", \"story_genre\": \"类型（悬疑/温情/科幻/荒诞）\"}}\n要求：\n1. 毒舌要像损友在你旁边说的话，精准针对环境里的某一个具体细节，不要泛泛而谈，不要网络段子\n2. 谜语要有意思，难度适中，老少皆宜\n3. 微故事是三段式：开头设场景、转折出人意料、结尾留余味；不要大团圆，不要鸡汤，像闪小说\n4. 三样都要和今天的环境（时间/天气/节日）有呼应\n只输出 JSON，不要解释。\n环境：{context}",
    "output_schema": {
      "roast": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "服务器也累了，和你一样需要休息。"
      },
      "riddle_category": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "谜语"
      },
      "riddle_question": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "两个胖子（打一城市名）"
      },
      "riddle_hint": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "想想体重"
      },
      "riddle_answer": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "合肥"
      },
      "story_title": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "末班车"
      },
      "story_opening": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "她每天都坐末班地铁，座位对面总是同一个男人在看书。"
      },
      "story_twist": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "有一天她终于鼓起勇气搭话，男人抬头，手里的书封面是她写的小说。"
      },
      "story_ending": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "小说的最后一章写的是：她从未搭话。"
      },
      "story_genre": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "温情"
      }
    },
    "temperature": 0.9,
    "fallback": {
      "roast": "服务器也累了，和你一样需要休息。",
      "riddle_category": "谜语",
      "riddle_question": "两个胖子（打一城市名）",
      "riddle_hint": "想想体重",
      "riddle_answer": "合肥",
      "story_title": "末班车",
      "story_opening": "她每天都坐末班地铁，座位对面总是同一个男人在看书。",
      "story_twist": "有一天她终于鼓起勇气搭话，男人抬头，手里的书封面是她写的小说。",
      "story_ending": "小说的最后一章写的是：她从未搭话。",
      "story_genre": "温情"
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "layout_engine": "component_tree",
    "status_bar": {
      "line_width": 1,
      "dashed": true
    },
    "component_theme": {
      "body_font": "noto_serif_regular",
      "body_font_size": 11,
      "body_line_gap": 4
    },
    "body": {
      "type": "column",
      "padding_x": 14,
      "padding_y": 4,
      "justify": "center",
      "gap": 3,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "field": "roast",
          "font": "noto_serif_bold",
          "font_size": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "max_lines": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "separator",
          "style": "short",
          "width": 44
        },
        {
          "type": "column",
          "gap": 2,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "field": "riddle_category",
              "font": "noto_serif_light",
              "font_size": 9,
              "align": "center",
              "max_lines": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "field": "riddle_question",
              "font": "noto_serif_bold",
              "font_size": 13,
              "align": "center",
              "max_lines": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "template": "提示：{riddle_hint}　谜底：{riddle_answer}",
              "font": "noto_serif_light",
              "font_size": 10,
              "align": "center",
              "max_lines": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "separator",
          "style": "short",
          "width": 44
        },
        {
          "type": "column",
          "gap": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "template": "{story_genre} · {story_title}",
              "font": "noto_serif_bold",
              "font_size": 12,
              "align": "center",
              "max_lines": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "field": "story_opening",
              "font": "noto_serif_regular",
              "font_size": 11,
              "align": "left",
              "max_lines": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "field": "story_twist",
              "font": "noto_serif_regular",
              "font_size": 11,
              "align": "left",
              "max_lines": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "field": "story_ending",
              "font": "noto_serif_light",
              "font_size": 11,
              "align": "left",
              "max_lines": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "footer": {
      "label": "日课三则",
      "attribution_template": "{story_genre}",
      "dashed": true
    }
  },
  "layout_overrides": {
